		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Giant, white-plumed eagle- godling from the Positive Energy Plane. Phoenix lord. Considered a divine omen.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 67, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +8 (2d12) or 2 energy feather (far) +8 (2d8) and piercing cry, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 14</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Energy Bird</strong>. Immune to fire.</p><p></p><p><strong>Piercing Cry</strong>. Fills a double near-sized cube extending from turul. CON 15+ or deafened. Cannot use again for 1d4 rounds. Can be heard for miles.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
